- Commit and push directly to `main`. Do not create feature branches or ask the user about branches.
- Never ask the user to run PowerShell, git, npm, or terminal commands. Handle everything autonomously.
- Do not show branch/checkout/commit dialogs or instructions to the user.
- Keep ViewerOne launch fully automatic: shortcut click syncs, builds, and opens with no popups.
